{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/277560/extras/30ccca6310ab79145531963bba8d5374.avif?t=1763038690\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something strange lurks within the monastery walls\u2014voices in empty corridors, tears from stone eyes. As the only one who can decode this mystery, you'll use your secret identity and keen perception to reveal a story of loss, betrayal, and dark devotion in this mysterious hidden object adventure game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/277560/extras/18248fa8d7eba5352f9eb9d2550faaf0.avif?t=1763038690\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Object &amp; Puzzle Adventure \u2013 investigate\u00a0 scenes and solve mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Dozens of locations &amp; mini-games \u2013 mystery lurks from every dark corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/277560/extras/531f28fff5cbc4db7324f75661b95106.avif?t=1763038690\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE your skills and your secret identity to reveal the terrifying truth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INVESTIGATE and EXPLORE the monastery and its surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERROGATE the inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND items and use them to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLVE perplexing puzzles and dozens of mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EARN many different achievements</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Speed run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/277560/7321c9e84cd73d27d2d5035cbdfe9f3b97fa50ae.jpg"},{"name":"Cardinal's agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/277560/6e19b5b586a710354c7bc68410922014a0bbb049.jpg"},{"name":"Trespasser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/277560/7f0160f1a0d01b79cf52889a14427af4193b71e7.jpg"},{"name":"Organ Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/277560/1d1d5099b4c